 "narrative": [
  "All courses counting toward the major must be taken for a letter grade.",
  "Students may take no more than three upper-division courses in any one department.",
  "Students can only overlap a maximum of two courses (eight units) between their major and minor.",
  "Maintain a 2.0 GPA.",
  "Students may petition to receive credit for relevant courses not listed in the catalog. All study abroad courses must be petitioned.",
  "The CLS major requires fifty-six units of study to complete the program (fourteen four-credit courses)."
 ]
